        "paragraph_number": 4,
        "obligation_type": "MANDATORY",
        "norm_statement": "Bracing failure is considered not to occur if its reduced width and section are at least 60% of the width and section required in the normal temperature calculation situation, provided that the fastening is done with nails, lag screws, pins or bolts.",
